      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Singularity V2 \u00d7 10Eros Max \u2014 PRISM-DMAD-PDMD I2V\nUpload one starting image, describe its motion, choose aspect ratio and seconds, then Queue. The image feeds reference conditioning and a frame-0 guide.\n\nAuthor preset: Euler, Beta57 (alpha 0.5 / beta 0.7), 8 steps, shifts 12/3, CFG 1. Acceleration is merged: do not add Turbo/DMAD acceleration LoRAs.\n\nPower LoRA Loader supports optional compatible MiniMax-H3 LoRAs. All are OFF initially; add your LoRA files under models/loras and select them here. Compatibility and strength depend on the LoRA.\n\n24 fps; 5 seconds rounds to 124 frames (~5.17 s). Native H3 frame count is 17k+5. Reference/keyframe support is verified in ComfyUI source; this merged checkpoint has not been GPU-tested here.\n\nCivitai version 3445524; author file PRISM_DMAD_PDMD_int8.safetensors. SHA256 matches Civitai.\nhttps://civitai.red/models/3019421?modelVersionId=3445524\nhttps://huggingface.co/OliviaRossi/Minimax-h3_Singularity-x-10Eros-Max_PRISM\n\nAUTO-PROMPT: Enter a short idea in the SHORT IDEA box. Qwen3.5-4B-heretic-v2 sees the same starting image and writes the full H3 prompt; Preview shows the result. Set Qwen duration to match the output seconds (default 5s). keep_model_loaded=false releases Qwen after expansion. passthrough=true uses your text literally. Use a seed greater than 1 so image changes affect the prompt cache."
      ]
    },
